---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Our Story | Casey Brothers Custom Builds">
  <Nav />

  <section class="pt-32 pb-6 bg-[#f5f0e8]">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
      <p class="eyebrow mb-4">About Us</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#211810] mb-6">Meet the Casey Brothers</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-[#f5f0e8] pb-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center mb-20">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[#4f4035] text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">At Casey Brothers Custom Builds, we believe every great space begins with thoughtful design. Before a single board is cut, we take the time to understand how you live, what inspires you, and how your space can work better for you.</p>
          <p class="text-[#4f4035] leading-relaxed mb-4">Whether you're starting with inspiration photos, a rough sketch, or simply an idea, we'll help transform your vision into a custom design tailored to your home. From built-ins and mudrooms to pantries, home offices, and beyond, every project is designed with purpose and built with care.</p>
          <p class="text-[#4f4035] leading-relaxed mb-4">We don't believe in one-size-fits-all solutions. Every home is different, and every project should reflect the people who live there. That's why we combine collaborative design with quality craftsmanship to create spaces that feel both beautiful and intentional.</p>
          <p class="text-[#4f4035] leading-relaxed">As a family-owned business, you'll work directly with us from your first conversation through the final installation. Our goal is to make the entire experience as rewarding as the finished space — creating something you'll enjoy every day for years to come.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <img src="/images/casey-brothers.png" alt="Zack and Logan Casey on a job site" class="rounded-sm w-full object-cover shadow-sm">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
        <div class="bg-[#fdf9f5] rounded p-8 border border-[#e6dfd4]">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#211810] mb-2">Zack Casey</h2>
          <p class="eyebrow mb-6">Co-Founder</p>
          <p class="text-[#4f4035] leading-relaxed mb-4">Outside of work, I'm usually planning our next trip with my wife, spending time with our dog Mack, or trying something new on the smoker.</p>
          <p class="text-[#4f4035] leading-relaxed">I enjoy coaching basketball, hosting friends and family, and making the most of any excuse to bring people together.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#fdf9f5] rounded p-8 border border-[#e6dfd4]">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-[#211810] mb-2">Logan Casey</h2>
          <p class="eyebrow mb-6">Co-Founder</p>
          <p class="text-[#4f4035] leading-relaxed mb-4">Outside of work, Logan enjoys spending time with his wife and son, caring for their dog, Honey, and playing guitar.</p>
          <p class="text-[#4f4035] leading-relaxed">One of his favorite pastimes is sharing his love of music with his son through his record collection.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
